          "originalSha256": "18946012ff489024a51e7d6fd318d3ea8202eea3501c36874bc68d1e5194cbd3",
          "excerpt": "十一月甲寅，誅太子太傅李崧及其弟司封員外郎嶼、國子博士嶬，夷其族，為部曲誣告故也。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-chengyou-bury-father",
      "title": "葬父睿陵",
      "summary": "在高祖刘知远灵驾启行后奉葬睿陵；本条日期只指十一月壬申的葬事，不把随后宗庙奉神主之礼也定在当天。",
      "year": 948,
      "sortOrder": 10,
      "precision": "day",
      "sourceDate": "乾祐元年十一月壬申",
      "phase": "rule",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v101",
          "paragraphId": "old-v101-p11",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "18946012ff489024a51e7d6fd318d3ea8202eea3501c36874bc68d1e5194cbd3",
          "excerpt": "壬申，葬高祖皇帝於睿陵。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v288",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v288-p68",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "52c10150bcc7f8a916650763e4db879b67e1c6e8fa0968010f958b8ff40d4801",
          "excerpt": "壬申，葬睿文聖武昭肅孝皇帝於睿陵，廟號高祖。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-chengyou-offer-reconciliation",
      "title": "诏三叛归顺可保富贵",
      "summary": "正月诏书表示三镇因疑惧而叛，若归顺则待之如初；收城后只责首恶，不追究受牵连者。",
      "year": 949,
      "sortOrder": 11,
      "precision": "day",
      "sourceDate": "乾祐二年正月乙巳朔",
      "phase": "rule",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p1",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "a1ced5cb1d01a0da395fc49beefd29586ad57c04b79196d98f1b876e37764565",
          "excerpt": "乾祐二年春正月乙巳朔，制曰："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p4",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "f40004de84157edd718f7e926c38adbd5f24c54db0e052ecae337bb850572dc5",
          "excerpt": "若能翻然歸順，朕即待之如初，當保始終，享其富貴，明申信誓，固無改移。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p4",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "f40004de84157edd718f7e926c38adbd5f24c54db0e052ecae337bb850572dc5",
          "excerpt": "候收復城池，罪止元惡，其餘詿誤，一切不問。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-chengyou-tax-relief",
      "title": "免额外米草征收",
      "summary": "免除乾祐元年按田亩另加征的白米与秆草欠额，已经缴纳的除外。",
      "year": 949,
      "sortOrder": 12,
      "precision": "day",
      "sourceDate": "乾祐二年二月丙子",
      "phase": "rule",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p7",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "a795a3ba22c212b452961f13dd462c5430d4cbe9897062963e22adadb74272c0",
          "excerpt": "二月丙子，詔：「諸道州府，所征乾祐元年夏秋苗畝上紐征白米稈草已納外，並放。」"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-chengyou-zhao-surrender",
      "title": "赵思绾请降获授华州",
      "summary": "赵思绾派刘成入朝求降，朝廷授其华州节度留后，但此后因拖延赴任和谋奔蜀而被杀。",
      "year": 949,
      "sortOrder": 13,
      "precision": "day",
      "sourceDate": "乾祐二年五月乙丑",
      "phase": "rule",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p10",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "79bfe9d3cc695e66211b9a11e321eb3652643ef0b0b05e6f741ab37bc4438c12",
          "excerpt": "乙丑，永興趙思綰遣牙將劉成詣闕乞降，制授趙思綰華州節度留後、檢校太保，以永興城內都指揮使常彥卿為虢州刺史。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "6949a4caa6729b9a6baf84895b93f6ac562ab5a6dd648ff5ebb0c188980c4f3b",
          "excerpt": "思綰欲於十一日夜與同惡五百人奔南山入蜀。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "6949a4caa6729b9a6baf84895b93f6ac562ab5a6dd648ff5ebb0c188980c4f3b",
          "excerpt": "臣尋與王峻入城，分兵守四門，其趙思綰部下軍，各已執帶，遂至牙署，令趙思綰至則執之，與一行徒黨，並處置訖。"
        }
